<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="artifact-type" content="tool">
  <meta name="design-style" content="canopy">
  <title>German Structure Lab — Grammar &amp; Syntax Practice</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Literata:ital,opsz,wght@0,7..72,400..700;1,7..72,400..600&family=Nunito+Sans:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@1.43.0/dist/umd/lucide.min.js"></script>
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: light;

      /* Canopy surfaces (warm organic & green-tinted) */
      --background: #f6f8f4;
      --surface-container-low: #ecf1e8;
      --surface-container: #e0e8da;
      --surface-container-high: #d3decc;
      --surface-card: #ffffff;

      /* Ink */
      --on-surface: #1f2b22;
      --on-surface-variant: #465649;

      /* Lines */
      --outline: #6c7c6f;
      --outline-variant: #c4d0bf;

      /* Accents */
      --primary: #2d6a45;
      --primary-hover: #235537;
      --on-primary: #ffffff;
      --primary-container: #d8efe0;
      --on-primary-container: #174328;
      --secondary: #4e6152;
      --tertiary: #8c561e;
      --tertiary-container: #f5dbb3;
      --on-tertiary-container: #63390b;
      --error: #b4322f;
      --error-container: #fbe8e7;
      --on-error: #ffffff;

      /* Semantic & focus */
      --positive: #2d6a45;
      --warning: #8c561e;
      --focus: #2d6a45;

      /* Fonts */
      --font-headline: 'Literata', serif;
      --font-body: 'Nunito Sans', sans-serif;
      --font-label: 'Geist Mono', monospace;

      /* Type scale (Focused Tool) */
      --display-size: clamp(1.75rem, 1.4rem + 1.2vw, 2.35rem);
      --headline-size: clamp(1.25rem, 1.1rem + 0.5vw, 1.55rem);
      --subhead-size: clamp(1.0625rem, 1rem + 0.25vw, 1.1875rem);
      --body-size: clamp(0.9375rem, 0.9rem + 0.15vw, 1rem);
      --label-size: 0.75rem;

      /* Spacing scale (4pt base) */
      --space-xs: 0.25rem;
      --space-sm: 0.5rem;
      --space-md: 1rem;
      --space-lg: 1.5rem;
      --space-xl: 2.5rem;
      --space-2xl: 4rem;

      /* Shape */
      --rounded: 0.625rem;
      --rounded-lg: 1rem;
      --rounded-full: 9999px;

      /* Effects */
      --shadow-soft: 0 4px 20px rgb(31 43 34 / 0.06);
      --shadow-soft-hover: 0 8px 28px rgb(31 43 34 / 0.10);
      --border-soft: 1px solid rgb(196 208 191 / 0.85);
      --focus-glow: 0 0 0 4px rgb(45 106 69 / 0.20);

      /* Motion */
      --ease-out: cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
      --ease-in-out: cubic-bezier(0.65, 0, 0.35, 1);
      --dur-micro: 120ms;
      --dur-short: 220ms;
      --dur-long: 420ms;
    }

    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html, body {
      overflow-x: clip;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: var(--background);
      color: var(--on-surface);
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: var(--body-size);
      line-height: 1.62;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    header { position: static !important; }

    button {
      font-family: inherit;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    :focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid var(--focus);
      outline-offset: 2px;
      box-shadow: var(--focus-glow);
    }

    .page-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: var(--space-xl);
      padding: var(--space-lg) var(--space-lg) var(--space-2xl);
      max-width: 1120px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .page-grid * { min-width: 0; }

    /* Top Header & Strip */
    .lab-header {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: var(--space-md);
      border-bottom: var(--border-soft);
      padding-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    }
    .header-top {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-end;
      gap: var(--space-md);
    }
    .kicker {
      font-family: var(--font-label);
      font-size: var(--label-size);
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: var(--tertiary);
      margin: 0 0 var(--space-xs);
    }
    .page-title {
      font-family: var(--font-headline);
      font-size: var(--display-size);
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.015em;
      line-height: 1.12;
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--on-surface);
    }
    .page-lede {
      margin: var(--space-xs) 0 0;
      color: var(--on-surface-variant);
      max-width: 64ch;
    }
    .header-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: var(--space-sm);
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    /* Telemetry Strip */
    .metrics-strip {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: var(--space-md);
    }
    .metric-tile {
      background: var(--surface-container-low);
      border-radius: var(--rounded-lg);
      padding: var(--space-md) var(--space-lg);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: var(--space-xs);
    }
    .metric-tile.is-leaf-highlight {
      background: var(--primary-container);
      color: var(--on-primary-container);
    }
    .metric-label {
      font-family: var(--font-label);
      font-size: var(--label-size);
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      color: var(--secondary);
    }
    .metric-tile.is-leaf-highlight .metric-label {
      color: var(--on-primary-container);
    }
    .metric-value {
      font-family: var(--font-headline);
      font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 1.2rem + 0.7vw, 1.85rem);
      font-weight: 600;
      line-height: 1.1;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }
    .metric-sub {
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      color: var(--on-surface-variant);
    }
    .metric-tile.is-leaf-highlight .metric-sub {
      color: var(--on-primary-container);
    }

    /* Category Filter Bar */
    .filter-bar {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      gap: var(--space-sm);
    }
    .filter-btn {
      min-height: 44px;
      padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
      border-radius: var(--rounded);
      border: var(--border-soft);
      background: var(--surface-card);
      color: var(--on-surface);
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: var(--space-sm);
      transition: background-color var(--dur-micro) var(--ease-out), color var(--dur-micro) var(--ease-out), box-shadow var(--dur-micro) var(--ease-out);
    }
    .filter-btn:hover {
      background: var(--surface-container-low);
    }
    .filter-btn.is-active {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: var(--on-primary);
      border-color: var(--primary);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
    }
    .filter-count {
      font-family: var(--font-label);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      padding: 2px 7px;
      border-radius: var(--rounded-full);
      background: var(--surface-container);
      color: var(--on-surface-variant);
    }
    .filter-btn.is-active .filter-count {
      background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.22);
      color: var(--on-primary);
    }

    /* Main Quiz Workspace */
    .quiz-workspace {
      background: var(--surface-card);
      border: var(--border-soft);
      border-radius: var(--rounded-lg);
      padding: var(--space-xl);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: var(--space-lg);
    }
    .quiz-meta-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: var(--space-sm);
    }
    .topic-badge {
      font-family: var(--font-label);
      font-size: var(--label-size);
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
      border-radius: var(--rounded-full);
      background: var(--primary-container);
      color: var(--on-primary-container);
    }
    .subrule-badge {
      font-family: var(--font-label);
      font-size: var(--label-size);
      color: var(--secondary);
    }

    .question-box {
      background: var(--surface-container-low);
      border-radius: var(--rounded-lg);
      padding: var(--space-lg) var(--space-xl);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);
    }
    .question-prompt {
      font-family: var(--font-headline);
      font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 1.05rem + 0.8vw, 1.65rem);
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 1.45;
      color: var(--on-surface);
      margin: 0;
    }
    .blank-slot {
      display: inline-block;
      min-width: 5.5rem;
      padding: 0 0.45rem;
      margin: 0 0.2rem;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary);
      color: var(--primary);
      font-weight: 700;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .blank-slot.is-correct {
      color: var(--positive);
      border-bottom-color: var(--positive);
    }
    .blank-slot.is-wrong {
      color: var(--error);
      border-bottom-color: var(--error);
    }

    /* Options Grid */
    .options-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: var(--space-md);
    }
    .option-btn {
      min-height: 54px;
      padding: var(--space-md) var(--space-lg);
      border-radius: var(--rounded);
      border: var(--border-soft);
      background: var(--surface-card);
      color: var(--on-surface);
      font-size: 1.0625rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-align: left;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: var(--space-sm);
      transition: background-color var(--dur-micro) var(--ease-out), transform var(--dur-micro) var(--ease-out), box-shadow var(--dur-micro) var(--ease-out);
    }
    .option-btn:hover:not(:disabled) {
      background: var(--surface-container-low);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
    }
    .option-btn:disabled {
      cursor: default;
    }
    .option-key {
      font-family: var(--font-label);
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background: var(--surface-container);
      color: var(--on-surface-variant);
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .option-text {
      flex: 1;
    }
    .option-btn.is-correct {
      background: var(--primary-container);
      color: var(--on-primary-container);
      border-color: var(--primary);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--primary);
    }
    .option-btn.is-correct .option-key {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: var(--on-primary);
    }
    .option-btn.is-wrong {
      background: var(--error-container);
      color: var(--error);
      border-color: var(--error);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--error);
    }
    .option-btn.is-wrong .option-key {
      background: var(--error);
      color: var(--on-error);
    }

    /* Post-answer Feedback Banner */
    .feedback-panel {
      border-radius: var(--rounded-lg);
      padding: var(--space-md) var(--space-lg);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: var(--space-sm);
      animation: fadeUp var(--dur-short) var(--ease-out);
    }
    .feedback-panel[hidden] { display: none; }
    .feedback-panel.is-correct {
      background: var(--primary-container);
      color: var(--on-primary-container);
    }
    .feedback-panel.is-wrong {
      background: var(--error-container);
      color: var(--error);
    }
    .feedback-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: var(--space-md);
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .feedback-status {
      font-family: var(--font-label);
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: var(--space-xs);
    }
    .feedback-translation {
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--on-surface);
      margin: 0;
    }
    .feedback-explanation {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--on-surface);
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    /* Quiz Footer Controls */
    .quiz-controls {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: var(--space-md);
      padding-top: var(--space-sm);
      border-top: var(--border-soft);
    }
    .btn-primary, .btn-secondary {
      min-height: 44px;
      padding: 0.625rem 1.25rem;
      border-radius: var(--rounded);
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: var(--space-sm);
      border: 0;
      transition: background-color var(--dur-micro) var(--ease-out), transform var(--dur-micro) var(--ease-out);
    }
    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: var(--on-primary);
    }
    .btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled) {
      background: var(--primary-hover);
    }
    .btn-primary:disabled {
      opacity: 0.45;
      cursor: not-allowed;
    }
    .btn-secondary {
      background: var(--surface-container);
      color: var(--on-surface);
    }
    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background: var(--surface-container-high);
    }
    .keyboard-hint {
      font-family: var(--font-label);
      font-size: var(--label-size);
      color: var(--secondary);
    }

    /* Completion State */
    .completion-box {
      background: var(--primary-container);
      color: var(--on-primary-container);
      border-radius: var(--rounded-lg);
      padding: var(--space-xl);
      text-align: center;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: var(--space-md);
    }
    .completion-box[hidden] { display: none; }

    /* Progress Strip (Pool coverage bar) */
    .pool-strip {
      background: var(--surface-container-low);
      border-radius: var(--rounded);
      padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: var(--space-md);
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .progress-track {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 180px;
      height: 10px;
      background: var(--surface-container-high);
      border-radius: var(--rounded-full);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .progress-fill {
      height: 100%;
      width: 0%;
      background: var(--primary);
      border-radius: var(--rounded-full);
      transition: width var(--dur-short) var(--ease-out);
    }

    /* Expanded Reference Guide */
    .reference-section {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: var(--space-lg);
      margin-top: var(--space-md);
      padding-top: var(--space-xl);
      border-top: 2px solid var(--outline-variant);
    }
    .section-heading {
      font-family: var(--font-headline);
      font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 1.25rem + 0.8vw, 1.95rem);
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--on-surface);
    }
    .section-intro {
      margin: var(--space-xs) 0 0;
      color: var(--on-surface-variant);
      max-width: 68ch;
    }

    .ref-tabs {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: var(--space-sm);
    }
    .ref-tab {
      min-height: 44px;
      padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
      border-radius: var(--rounded);
      border: var(--border-soft);
      background: var(--surface-container-low);
      color: var(--on-surface);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
    }
    .ref-tab.is-active {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: var(--on-primary);
      border-color: var(--primary);
    }

    .ref-panel {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(320px, 100%), 1fr));
      gap: var(--space-lg);
    }
    .ref-panel[hidden] { display: none; }

    .ref-card {
      background: var(--surface-container-low);
      border-radius: var(--rounded-lg);
      padding: var(--space-lg);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: var(--space-md);
    }
    .ref-card.is-wide {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      background: var(--surface-card);
      border: var(--border-soft);
    }
    .ref-card-title {
      font-family: var(--font-headline);
      font-size: var(--headline-size);
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--on-surface);
    }
    .ref-card p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--on-surface-variant);
    }
    .rule-list {
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 1.25rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: var(--space-sm);
    }
    .rule-list li {
      color: var(--on-surface);
    }
    .example-chip {
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: var(--font-label);
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      background: var(--surface-card);
      border: var(--border-soft);
      padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      color: var(--on-surface);
    }
    .tag-ochre {
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: var(--font-label);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      background: var(--tertiary-container);
      color: var(--on-tertiary-container);
      padding: 0.15rem 0.55rem;
      border-radius: var(--rounded-full);
    }
    .tag-green {
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: var(--font-label);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      background: var(--primary-container);
      color: var(--on-primary-container);
      padding: 0.15rem 0.55rem;
      border-radius: var(--rounded-full);
    }

    /* Reference Tables */
    .table-wrap {
      width: 100%;
      overflow-x: auto;
    }
    table.ref-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      text-align: left;
    }
    table.ref-table th {
      font-family: var(--font-label);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      color: var(--secondary);
      background: var(--surface-container-low);
      padding: 0.75rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--outline-variant);
    }
    table.ref-table td {
      padding: 0.75rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--outline-variant);
      vertical-align: top;
    }
    table.ref-table tr:last-child td {
      border-bottom: 0;
    }
    .de-word {
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--primary);
    }

    /* Sentence Bracket Diagram */
    .bracket-diagram {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
      gap: var(--space-sm);
      align-items: stretch;
      background: var(--surface-card);
      border: var(--border-soft);
      border-radius: var(--rounded);
      padding: var(--space-md);
    }
    .bracket-slot {
      padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
      border-radius: 6px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .bracket-slot.is-v2 {
      background: var(--primary-container);
      color: var(--on-primary-container);
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .bracket-slot.is-mid {
      background: var(--surface-container-low);
      color: var(--on-surface-variant);
    }
    .bracket-slot.is-end {
      background: var(--tertiary-container);
      color: var(--on-tertiary-container);
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .bracket-caption {
      display: block;
      font-family: var(--font-label);
      font-size: 0.6875rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin-bottom: 2px;
      opacity: 0.85;
    }

    .footer-note {
      color: var(--on-surface-variant);
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      border-top: var(--border-soft);
      padding-top: var(--space-md);
    }

    @keyframes fadeUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .metrics-strip {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }
      .options-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .quiz-workspace {
        padding: var(--space-lg);
      }
      .question-box {
        padding: var(--space-md);
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .page-grid {
        padding: var(--space-md) var(--space-sm) var(--space-xl);
        gap: var(--space-lg);
      }
      .bracket-diagram {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after {
        animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        scroll-behavior: auto !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page-grid">
    <header class="lab-header">
      <div class="header-top">
        <div>
          <p class="kicker">Deutsche Grammatik · Level A1–B1</p>
          <h1 class="page-title">German Structure Lab</h1>
          <p class="page-lede">Targeted multiple-choice practice across 1,000 realistic sentences covering prepositions and contractions, separable verbs, and clause word order—paired with a complete structural reference guide.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="header-actions">
          <button type="button" class="btn-secondary" id="reset-btn" onclick="handleResetClick(this)">
